="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/98f735f2/img_006_c809950e.png" alt="Q equals, T over P"></span>. Therefore, <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/98f735f2/img_007_c809950e.png" alt="Q equals, T over P "></span> gives the quantity of product sold in terms of <span class="italic">P</span> and <span class="italic">T</span>.<p>Choice A is incorrect and may result from an error when dividing both sides of the given equation by <span class="italic">P.</span> Choice C is incorrect and may result from multiplying, rather than dividing, both sides of the given equation by <span class="italic">P</span>. Choice D is incorrect and may result from subtracting <span class="italic">P</span> from both sides of the equation rather than dividing both sides by <span class="italic">P</span>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>
