g" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/a0b4103e/img_013_7445a232.png" alt="one third"></span> and rewriting the expression as <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/a0b4103e/img_014_170d8c9c.png" alt="one third times, open parenthesis, x squared, minus 2, close parenthesis"></span>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>
