ncorrect. Squaring the binomial and simplifying the expression in choice A gives <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/a1bf1c4e/img_004_b04fd5a0.png" alt="x squared, plus 6 x, plus 9, plus 5"></span>. Combining like terms gives <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/a1bf1c4e/img_005_82d05eb4.png" alt="x squared, minus 6 x, plus 14"></span>, not <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/a1bf1c4e/img_006_8caa07b2.png" alt="x squared, plus 6 x, plus 4"></span>. Choice C is incorrect. Squaring the binomial and simplifying the expression in choice C gives <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/a1bf1c4e/img_007_3f7413a7.png" alt="x squared, minus 6 x, plus 9, plus 5"></span>. Combining like terms gives <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/a1bf1c4e/img_008_784a7b52.png" alt="x squared, minus 6 x, plus 14"></span>, not <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/a1bf1c4e/img_009_8caa07b2.png" alt="x squared, plus 6 x, plus 4"></span>. Choice D is incorrect. Squaring the binomial and simplifying the expression in choice D gives <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/a1bf1c4e/img_010_71bfbb21.png" alt="x squared, minus 6 x, plus 9, minus 5"></span>. Combining like terms gives <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/a1bf1c4e/img_011_8ebde7be.png" alt="x squared, minus 6 x, plus 4"></span>, not <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/a1bf1c4e/img_012_8caa07b2.png" alt="x squared, plus 6 x, plus 4"></span>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>
